			"notes": "First release of Future+, a helper (addon) utility client that runs alongside the Future client and adds modules Future doesn't have.\n\n**Requirements:** Minecraft 26.1.2, Fabric Loader, Fabric API. Sodium is embedded in the jar.\n\n**Install:** put `futureplus.jar` in your `mods` folder next to Future. Open the ClickGUI with Right Shift.\n\n**Modules:** PistonAura (with a Grim mode for 2b2t), AntiPhase, Blocker, MaceAura, AnchorAura, Suicide, FakePlayer+, FakeFly, Skybox+, Hand Tweaks, Hand Shader, KillEffects, Font+"
